* Run this module in the FULL-DIMER AB RunFile/ONEINT/Cholesky context.
* B.RunFile is the final accepted source RASSCF RunFile.
* A.RunFile is the target fragment RunFile that will later be used by
* target-fragment RASSCF with partner-B nuclei supplied through XField.
*
* Example AO ordering: A = 1...120, B = 121...240.

&EXACTEMB
SOURCE
B.RunFile
121
TARGET
A.RunFile
1
TOLERANCE
1.0d-6
PRINT
1
END
